OL,3,GNEWSAHappy GCSE wait is over, says
OL,4,Aaspiring teacher
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents at schools and colleges across
OL,7,FJersey and Guernsey have received their
OL,8,FGCSE results.
OL,10,FPupils in Jersey achieved a pass rate
OL,11,Fof 77.1% of results graded 4-9 (grade C
OL,12,Fand above) and 26.7% at the highest
OL,13,Fgrades 7-9 (A/A*) while students in
OL,14,FGuernsey and Alderney achieved a 71.2%
OL,15,Fpass rate for grades 4 and above.
OL,17,FCareers advisers on both islands were
OL,18,Favailable to help students plan their
OL,19,Fnext steps.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
