OL,3,GNEWSAHappy GCSE wait is over, says
OL,4,Aaspiring teacher
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Guernsey, Elizabeth College student
OL,7,FPhoebe, who is considering a career in
OL,8,Fteaching, said the lead-up to her
OL,9,Fresults was "nerve-racking" but she got
OL,10,Fthe results she was hoping for.
